<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2937" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκαπν-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without smoke, free from
			it</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκέπη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Acut.</u>
					65
				</span></i>
			; <i>not smoking, making no smoke</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Ign.</u>
					71
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυσία ἄ</span>. an offering but
				<i>no burnt offering</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Am.</u>
				4
			</span></i>; so a poem is called 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Καλλιόπης ἄ. θύος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.321
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>): —<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκαπνα γὰρ αἰὲν
				ἀοιδοὶ θύομεν</span> we sacrifice <i>without a fire of
				our own</i>, i.e. live at others' expense, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				53P.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκάπνιστος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				11.45
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκαπνον, τό,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σάμψουχον</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.39
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
